     :     VisibilityFilterExec: tables=[a, b]
     :       HashJoinExec: mode=CollectLeft, join_type=Inner, on=[(id@1, id@1)], filter=pdb_float_div(x@0, d@1) > 1 OR pdb_float_div(x@0, d@1) IS NULL, projection=[ctid_0@0, id@1, ctid_1@3, id@4]
     :         CooperativeExec
     :           PgSearchScan: table=a, segments=1, dynamic_filters=1, query={"boolean":{"must":[{"with_index":{"query":{"parse_with_field":{"field":"body","query_string":"ok","lenient":null,"conjunction_mode":null}}}},{"boolean":{"must":[{"exists":{"field":"id"}}],"must_not":[{"term":{"field":"id","value":12}}]}}]}}
     :         CooperativeExec
     :           PgSearchScan: table=b, segments=1, dynamic_filters=1, query="all"
(15 rows)

